{"id":"2580bb79563bf7ee","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds.md","title":"ZFC Geology Downward Directed Grounds","display":"df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds — ZFC Geology Downward Directed Grounds","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds","aliases":["58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds"],"display":"df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds — ZFC Geology Downward Directed Grounds","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds — ZFC Geology Downward Directed Grounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> (ambient universe class in the definable-class metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\">\\(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\)</span> (ground-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0244462250ae67e\" href=\"?note=d0244462250ae67e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ground.md\">../batch06/58-df-ground.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DownwardDirectedGrounds}\">\\(\\operatorname{DownwardDirectedGrounds}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}downward\\text{-}directed\\text{-}grounds} \\vdash \\operatorname{DownwardDirectedGrounds}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\forall W_0,W_1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_0,V)\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_1,V)\\to\\exists W\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\land W\\subseteq W_0\\cap W_1)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}downward\\text{-}directed\\text{-}grounds} \\vdash \\operatorname{DownwardDirectedGrounds}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\forall W_0,W_1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_0,V)\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_1,V)\\to\\exists W\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\land W\\subseteq W_0\\cap W_1)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Grounds are class variables selected by the ground-model predicate rather than elements of a set-sized family.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ground.md","status":"resolved","id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)$ (ground-model predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-ground.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DownwardDirectedGrounds}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}geology\\text{-}downward\\text{-}directed\\text{-}grounds} \\vdash \\operatorname{DownwardDirectedGrounds}(V)\\leftrightarrow\\forall W_0,W_1\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_0,V)\\land\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W_1,V)\\to\\exists W\\;(\\mathrm{GroundModel}_S(W,V)\\land W\\subseteq W_0\\cap W_1)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1106,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds.md|58-df-zfc-geology-downward-directed-grounds]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d0244462250ae67e"]}